{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01075",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 2.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.51,
      "end_seconds": 8.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.48,
      "end_seconds": 18.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "It's shaking chills and a high temperature. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.5,
      "end_seconds": 22.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.61,
      "end_seconds": 25.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.29,
      "end_seconds": 30.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.53,
      "end_seconds": 60.62,
      "duration_seconds": 29.09,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a racing heart as well. Hmm, as for feeling confused, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About racing heart, moderate, really. It comes and goes. I've had very little urine too, for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.63,
      "end_seconds": 64.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "And chest pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.08,
      "end_seconds": 68.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "No, none, no chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.34,
      "end_seconds": 73.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "And what about rash or stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.56,
      "end_seconds": 76.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.87,
      "end_seconds": 84.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.92,
      "end_seconds": 88.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.35,
      "end_seconds": 94.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.23,
      "end_seconds": 105.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.06,
      "end_seconds": 118.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.13,
      "end_seconds": 128.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "I have an enlarged prostate. Diabetes, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.68,
      "end_seconds": 136.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Yes. Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.87,
      "end_seconds": 149.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.73,
      "end_seconds": 157.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "I take Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.2,
      "end_seconds": 172.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.29,
      "end_seconds": 187.68,
      "duration_seconds": 14.39,
      "text": "I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.1,
      "end_seconds": 191.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.62,
      "end_seconds": 206.35,
      "duration_seconds": 13.73,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I hardly move around during the day. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.43,
      "end_seconds": 212.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.18,
      "end_seconds": 214.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.8,
      "end_seconds": 235.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "You are hot, your heart is racing and your blood pressure is low, which worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.85,
      "end_seconds": 250.89,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Having listened and examined, it points towards possible sepsis needing urgent treatment. A severe urine or chest infection is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.86,
      "end_seconds": 255.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.29,
      "end_seconds": 278.49,
      "duration_seconds": 21.2,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible sepsis needing urgent treatment, and we'll know more once the a chest X-ray is back. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had shaking chills and a high temperature for four weeks, and no rash or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.29,
      "end_seconds": 280.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.58,
      "end_seconds": 286.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Let's book a chest X-ray to look into fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 290.53,
      "end_seconds": 293.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "The earliest is Thursday, 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.57,
      "end_seconds": 309.47,
      "duration_seconds": 14.9,
      "text": "I want blood cultures done, that's for fever with low blood pressure. I want to admit you to hospital now for fluids and antibiotics. Right, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.57,
      "end_seconds": 313.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}